# Per-project SwarmForge model/effort overrides for square_client.
# Sourced by the swarmforge launcher before per-role model and effort are
# resolved. Plain zsh assignments only. No secrets — safe to commit.
#
# architect: claude-fable-5 is already swarmforge.sh's hardcoded default
# for this role, so it's left unset here and just tracks that default.
# reviewer:  claude-opus-4-8 is also the hardcoded default; only effort is
# pinned to medium (default would be xhigh) to keep review turnaround
# reasonable on a library this size.
# coder:     claude-sonnet-5 is the hardcoded default; effort is pinned to
# high (default would be xhigh) for implementation slices.
SWARMFORGE_REVIEWER_EFFORT=medium
SWARMFORGE_CODER_EFFORT=high
